{
  "dom_id": "step-q317913",
  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "If $p=⟨5,-2,0,3⟩$ and $q=⟨1,3,10,-5⟩$, then $p\\cdot q=${{field-1}}.",
  "worked_solution": "Summing up the products of corresponding components, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p\\cdot q & ={p}_{1}\\cdot {q}_{1}+{p}_{2}\\cdot {q}_{2}+{p}_{3}\\cdot {q}_{3}+{p}_{4}\\cdot {q}_{4} \\\\  & =5\\cdot 1+(-2)\\cdot 3+0\\cdot 10+3\\cdot (-5) \\\\  & =5-6+0-15 \\\\  & =-16.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
